  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  m_Text: Switch between the anatomical and inflated representations. Inflation is
    designed for cortical surfaces but is available to any geometrically admissible
    mesh. Sites and electrodes remain in anatomical coordinates, and their influence
    is computed from the anatomical reference surface. Cuts also remain anatomical
    and do not visually clip the inflated surface.
